WEBVTT

00:00:07.921 --> 00:00:08.870
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Who’s that?

00:00:09.944 --> 00:00:11.945
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> That’s my sister, Lena.

00:00:15.234 --> 00:00:20.015
And this is my brother Stefan with my nephew, Leon.

00:00:24.658 --> 00:00:26.262
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Is that another sister?

00:00:27.233 --> 00:00:31.113
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> No, that’s my cousin, Nadya, and her husband Alex.